The desktop app's own browser (apps/desktop/src/browser) contains code
adapted from T3 Code, which J3 Bots runs as its engine and does not modify
(decisions 0001 and 0110 in the J3 Bots repository). Each file that holds
such code says so at its top, with the file it comes from.

T3 Code, at v0.1.13 (commit bc0f04da94f64b5e487c598761a43b4cf06b2ac9)
  Source: https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code
  Adapted here:
    apps/desktop/src/preview/BrowserSession.ts
      the permissions a page holds without asking, and the client hints
      added to navigations, in src/browser/policy.ts and
      src/browser/identity.ts
    apps/desktop/src/preview/DesktopBrowserHost.ts
      a tab's page reached by Playwright through its own debugger, a
      hidden tab painting while it is driven, and a download placed by
      who began it, in src/browser/relay.ts, src/browser/tab.ts and
      src/browser/host.ts
